          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.269,
            0.847,
            0.309
          ],
          "content": "1. A 210 gram packet of peanut chikki costs ₹70.5, while a 110 gram packet of potato chips costs ₹33.25. Which is cheaper?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.313,
            0.64,
            0.333
          ],
          "content": "2. Write the decimal number at the arrow mark:"
