          "image_source": "images/page_26_image_9.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.762,
            0.848,
            0.842
          ],
          "content": "4. A teacher placed textbooks that are 2.5 cm thick on a bookshelf. The teacher wanted to place 80 textbooks on the shelf. The bookshelf is 160 cm long. How many books could be placed on the shelf? Was there any space left? If yes, how much?"
        },
